<h2 id="san-diego-kitchen-design-trends">San Diego Kitchen Design Trends</h2>
<p>San Diego kitchens lean light and coastal — white and warm-neutral palettes, white-oak and walnut accents, natural textures, and seamless connections to outdoor living. The luxury coastal communities of La Jolla, Del Mar, and Rancho Santa Fe increasingly favor handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens, while inland and North County remodels keep transitional styling popular.</p>
